    "description": "Title\n:   Rock Mineral Fossil Collection Lot w. Assorted Geodes Polished Stones Shells Mixed Specimens Educational\nOptional title\n: Natural Stone & Crystal Collection: Geodes, Tumbled Gems\nDepartment\n: Science & Education\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Explore the fascinating world of geology with this premium collection of natural stones and crystals, perfect for education, study, or display. This set includes an array of tumbled gemstones, polished fossil stones, unique geode candle holders (one amethyst), and natural minerals, each selected for its eye-catching colors, patterns, and textures. Individual items include fossil coral stones, polished river rocks, a hand-carved gemstone dodecahedron, natural seashells, and various tumbled crystal varieties such as quartz, jasper, and agate. The geode candleholders make striking decorative pieces and conversation starters. Ideal for classrooms, collectors, or home decor enthusiasts, these specimens highlight the beauty and diversity of Earth's natural treasures. Every piece in this assortment has been carefully chosen for authenticity and quality, ensuring a unique addition to your collection. Add natural charm to your learning or living space, and shop confidentlythese stones and crystals are sustainably sourced and handled with care.\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
